---
import FigureViewport from './FigureViewport.astro';
import {createRequire} from 'node:module';
const require=createRequire(new URL('../../../package.json',import.meta.url));
const katex=createRequire(require.resolve('rehype-katex'))('katex');
const tex=(s:string)=>katex.renderToString(s,{throwOnError:true});
const profile=(leftOnly=false)=>Array.from({length:401},(_,i)=>{
 const x=-4+8*i/400;if(leftOnly&&x>-1.2)return '';
 return `${i?'L':'M'}${(24+(x+4)*54).toFixed(2)},${(214-125/Math.cosh(1.5*x)).toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---
<figure id="bound-tail-intro" class="bound-tail" aria-labelledby="bound-tail-caption">
 <FigureViewport width={480}><svg width="480" height="324" role="img" aria-labelledby="bound-tail-title bound-tail-desc">
  <title id="bound-tail-title">c n is the normalized bound state's left-tail amplitude</title>
  <desc id="bound-tail-desc">A localized normalized bound-state profile has its left tail highlighted. A leader connects this tail to c n of t times exp kappa n x, as x tends to minus infinity. The normalization integral equals one for the complete state.</desc>
  <foreignObject x="30" y="4" width="420" height="48"><div class="normalization" set:html={tex('\\int_{\\mathbb R}|\\psi_n(x,t)|^2\\,dx=1')} /></foreignObject>
  <foreignObject x="187" y="57" width="106" height="30"><div class="state" set:html={tex('\\psi_n(x,t)')} /></foreignObject>
  <path d="M24 214H456" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.3" />
  <path d={profile()} fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2.7" />
  <path d={profile(true)} fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="4" />
  <path d="M120 247L142 227L154 193" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" />
  <circle cx="154" cy="193" r="3" fill="var(--accent)" />
  <foreignObject x="12" y="249" width="235" height="36"><div class="tail-term" set:html={tex('c_n(t)\\,e^{\\kappa_nx}')} /></foreignObject>
  <foreignObject x="12" y="288" width="235" height="30"><div class="left-end" set:html={tex('x\\to-\\infty')} /></foreignObject>
  <foreignObject x="427" y="217" width="40" height="28"><div class="axis" set:html={tex('x')} /></foreignObject>
 </svg></FigureViewport>
 <figcaption id="bound-tail-caption">全体のノルムを1にそろえた束縛状態の、左端の尾に付く係数が <span set:html={tex('c_n(t)')} /> である。図は一つの束縛状態を模式的に示している。</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
.bound-tail{scroll-margin-top:78px;width:100%;margin:1.5rem auto;color:var(--ink)}
.normalization,.state,.tail-term,.left-end,.axis{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;height:100%;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1}
.normalization{font-size:21px}.state{font-size:21px}.tail-term{font-size:27px;color:var(--accent)}.left-end{font-size:21px;color:var(--accent)}.axis{font-size:19px}
.bound-tail :global(.katex){color:inherit}.bound-tail figcaption{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.65}
</style>
